# Storage by tier

Stacked, because the total is meaningful and the parts sum to it. Two
unstacked translucent areas would already be near the readable limit; three
would not be a chart.

```mdv area
title: Storage by tier
x: month
y: [hot, warm, cold]
stack: normal
format: table
---
month   |  hot | warm | cold
2026-03 | 12.4 | 31.0 | 88.2
2026-04 | 13.1 | 33.5 | 91.7
2026-05 | 14.8 | 34.2 | 96.4
2026-06 | 15.2 | 36.9 | 99.1
```
